Widen the dashboard's Worktree column, and lead with the branch.

The cell rendered `<handle> →<branch>` truncated at a fixed 25 columns,
with the column clamped to the same, so the branch was cut off at any
terminal width -- freed width went to `git` instead. Derive the cap from
the pane (half its width, bounded 25..80) and thread it through.

Also render `<branch> → <handle>`: the branch is the identity worth
reading, so it should be what survives a truncation, and the arrow reads
better spaced.

